{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the fallen god, 'Signa,' leave a myth of light on this land.\u00a0<br><br><br>The masterpieces of old arcades had something more important than just being fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Great graphics? Controls using joysticks? \u00a0They had something more important than that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">'Masterpieces looked fun at first glance.'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Games with beautiful art at first glance.<br>Games that you could understand at first glance.<br>Games that looking fun at first glance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">'A Straightforward game.'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That's SignaNota.<br><br><br>Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We have more than a hundred short - animations!\u00a0<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974620/extras/Commercial_2.gif?t=1744851622\" /></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A totally new combat system awaits you. Pull and launch <i>Signa</i>!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974620/extras/Commercial_4.gif?t=1744851622\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're not limited to just one companion. There are six heroines to accompany you.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974620/extras/Commercial_3.gif?t=1744851622\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are multiple endings. Each heroine offers a unique ending.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974620/extras/Commercial_1.gif?t=1744851622\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perhaps, there might even be a hidden ending to uncover.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2974620?t=1744851622","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974620/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744851622","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974620/ab1fd168a234a91e10f39c041f9ecd9381cac0eb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744851622","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974620/ab1fd168a234a91e10f39c041f9ecd9381cac0eb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744851622","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the fallen god, 'Signa,' leave a myth of light on this land.\u00a0<br><br><br>The masterpieces of old arcades had something more important than just being fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Great graphics? Controls using joysticks? \u00a0They had something more important than that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">'Masterpieces looked fun at first glance.'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Games with beautiful art at first glance.<br>Games that you could understand at first glance.<br>Games that looking fun at first glance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">'A Straightforward game.'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That's SignaNota.<br><br><br>Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We have more than a hundred short - animations!\u00a0<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974620/extras/Commercial_2.gif?t=1744851622\" /></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A totally new combat system awaits you. Pull and launch <i>Signa</i>!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974620/extras/Commercial_4.gif?t=1744851622\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're not limited to just one companion. There are six heroines to accompany you.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974620/extras/Commercial_3.gif?t=1744851622\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are multiple endings. Each heroine offers a unique ending.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974620/extras/Commercial_1.gif?t=1744851622\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perhaps, there might even be a hidden ending to uncover.</p></li></ul>","developers":["IvoryHand"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974620/header.jpg?t=1744851622","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257093401,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257093401/movie480.mp4?t=1742459666","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257093401/movie_max.mp4?t=1742459666"},"name":"15sec","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257093401/d8743f28bf4e902fec4338febd967ad0121ad382/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742459666","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257093401/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1742459666","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257093401/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1742459666"}}],"name":"SignaNota","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Pentium G5500 / Core i3-6100 / AMD Ryzen3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 750Ti / AMD HD 7790<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br>